    {
      "text": "Explicit evaluation of the q -Stokes matrices for certain conﬂuent hypergeometric q -diﬀerence equations — We prove a connection formula for the basic hypergeomtric function nϕn−1 (a1, ..., an−1, 0\n\n**Explicit evaluation of the q -Stokes matrices for certain conﬂuent hypergeometric q -diﬀerence equations**\n\n*Jinghong Lin, Yiming Ma and Xiaomeng Xu*\n\n28 pp, 17 sections.\n\n**Abstract.** We prove a connection formula for the basic hypergeomtric function nϕn−1 (a1, ..., an−1, 0; b1, ..., bn−1; q, z) by using the q-Borel resummation. As an application, we compute q-Stokes matrices of a special conﬂuent hypergeometric q-diﬀerence system with an irregular singularity. We show that by letting q →1, the q-Stokes matrices recover the known expressions of the Stokes matrices of the corresponding conﬂuent hypergeometric diﬀerential system.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; Introduction; Connection Formula of the Equation (5); Basic Notations; Basic Hypergeometric Series; q-Borel Resummation; Explicit Expression of Connection Formula of t; Connection Matrix, q-Stokes Matrix of the Syst; Fundamental Solution, Connection Matrix and q-; Diagonalization of the Upper Left Submatrix of; Fundamental Solutions of the System (33); Relationship between the System (33) and the E; Explicit Evaluation of Connection Matrix and q; Explicit Evaluation of Connection Matrix and q; Behavior of the Equation (5) and the System (2; Behavior of the Connection Formula as q1; Behavior of Connection Matrix and q-Stokes Mat",
